#AREADATA
Name        { 5 35} Tyu     Teikoku Headquarters~
Builders    None~
VNUMs       9800 9808
Security    1
Recall      3001
End



#HELPS

0 EXODUS~
Founders- Exodus was originally founded by a group of friends with Vixa as
as their not so fearless leader. Sokarr is currently the "second in command"
and can also join people. As we are friends in real life we are a pretty tight
knit group.

Requirements-
1) I think the most important thing is not your pkill ability, but that your
default personality isn't asshole. I have very little tolerance for rudeness
in general. While it is a game we have to deal with you in the clan and LIKE
your personality to join. 
2) Ability to defend yourself- Every person is different and we do not mind
helping you to develop in your class but you have to be at a point where you
can defend yourself. This is normally around maniacal. I don't care about
your personal pkill assessment, I understand unclanned powerfuls get hit hard.
3) Sense of humor- You should revere the genuis of Kevin Smith. Ok so this 
isn't necessary but you'll get the whole clan theme a whole lot better if
you do ;)

Ranks- They don't matter in Exodus. If we like you enough to join you are pretty
much equal. Like I said before we are friends and we try treat the people in the
as such. You get a say in what we order, who we join, who we banish. Even if I
like you and want you to join the clan needs to agree. 

Vixa 20/09/00
~

0 $~

#MOBILES
#9800
bald guard~
A small, bald man~
A small, bald man is standing here, watching you closely.
~
He is seems rather weak, but is actually a master of Shaolin.
Brown robes fall loosely around him and a pair of ruggish sandals
hold his feet.
~
16483 66216 0 S
96 0 0 0d0+0 0d0+0
0 0
0 0 1
>speech_prog gate danger law guard trouble city recall~
if rand(14)
mpecho $I says 'Keep your weapon down unless you want the street to remember you poorly.'
else
if rand(17)
mpecho $I says 'If you get lost, recall. If recall fails, you picked the wrong room or the wrong curse.'
else
if rand(20)
mpecho $I says 'Gates let trouble in. I'm the part that decides how it leaves.'
else
if rand(25)
mpecho $I says 'I've stood at this post so long I've named the cracks in the wall. That one's Gerald. Don't touch Gerald.'
else
if rand(33)
mpecho $I says 'Crime's down this month. Mostly because the criminals keep wandering into things with teeth.'
else
if rand(50)
mpecho $I says 'You look suspicious. Everyone looks suspicious. That's the job. Move along.'
else
mpecho $I adjusts a halberd that has clearly never needed sharpening and never will.
endif
endif
endif
endif
endif
endif
~
|
