shopkeeper wufei~
Wufei~
Wufei, a former Gundam pilot, watches you carefully.
~
Wufei is a strong, tall, and very honorable
fighter.  His presence gives you the spirit
of fighting.  He stands next to the depository
of Gundam munitions very attentively.  Though
he says nothing, you understand he's here to
help with your supplies.
~
