#9800
Entrance of the Teikoku~
You see the entrance to the Empire. A huge stone wall surrounds it.
On the inside, beautiful fountains show their pure water.
Behind this, you see the castle that shelters the infamous dojo.
A large gong stands next to you, used as an alarm for intruders.
