Watch Tower~
High above the gates to Teikoku, you stand atop the watch tower
surveying the land before you. The archers here guard the clan
from would be invaders; their accuracy has no equal. By stepping
into the tower, you take on the full responsibilities of those
who guard you and keep you safe from outside harm.
